   <narrative xml:lang="EN">H.O.P.E in Action: Harnessing Opportunities for the Promotion of Women&apos;s Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Among the population groups affected by the 2023 Kahramanmaras earthquakes, individuals facing intersecting inequalities particularly women require targeted policies to ensure that T&#xfc;rkiye&#x2019;s earthquake response truly leaves no one behind. Through the design and implementation of a model project, the aim is to equip women with the tools, resources, and opportunities they need for self-sufficiency and full inclusion in society. Taking a holistic approach, the project combines vocational training,</narrative>
  </description>
